<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh June M2 up 3.8 pct m/m, up 8.2 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh June M2 up 3.8 pct m/m, up 8.2 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's M2 money supply rose 3.8 percent in June to 456.8 billion taka after a 0.27 percent rise to 439.9 billion in May, central bank officials said.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise was 8.2 percent to June, 1996.</p>
<p>BANGLADESH'S MONEY SUPPLY</p>
<p>					 JUNE    MAY     JUNE 1995</p>
<p>    M2 money supply (bln taka) 456.8   439.9   422.1</p>
<p>    M1 money supply (bln taka) 144.5   139.3   131.7</p>
</text>
